      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You know, for a platform that aims to be safe for its users you would think this would be a no brainer for VRC. \nI hope this gets marked as under review or in progress soon. \nHere are MY reasons why.\n- People with panic disorders can (mostly) hide jumpscare avatars more easily \n- DJ events etc can enforce specific types of avatars\n- People with photosensitivity issues can hide flashy avatars\nAlso please PLEASE let this be a prompt when making a new account, so users know to set their preferences from the get go.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
